\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces  (a) The overall architecture of MultiStripMamba. (b) VSS Block is the main construction of our encoder. (c) Multi-Scale Convolutional Gate (MSCG) can enhance features from skip connections. (d) Multi-Scale Convolutional Block(MSCB), progressing patches in all dimensions to further enhance features, is the main component of our decoder. (e) Multi-scale Convolution (MSC). (f) Channel attention block(CA). (g) Spatial attention block(SA). (h) Strip block. (i) Strip module. (j) Feed-Forward Network(FFN). }}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{figure1}{{1}{4}{(a) The overall architecture of MultiStripMamba. (b) VSS Block is the main construction of our encoder. (c) Multi-Scale Convolutional Gate (MSCG) can enhance features from skip connections. (d) Multi-Scale Convolutional Block(MSCB), progressing patches in all dimensions to further enhance features, is the main component of our decoder. (e) Multi-scale Convolution (MSC). (f) Channel attention block(CA). (g) Spatial attention block(SA). (h) Strip block. (i) Strip module. (j) Feed-Forward Network(FFN)}{figure.1}{}}
